    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds from a third-person perspective. Players take control of girls who must navigate a scenario while avoiding dangerous traps.\u00a0In this game you will die many times! And in the most violent and agonizing ways possible. STAY ALIVE is a game of trial and error. Discover the limits of your patience and test your skills \u2013 how far can you go without dying in the attempt? Bloody game.</p>",
